{"id":"18c60e266bed3d1d24caebbe8a97483989fffa3b69dbde7d","commits":["33082f7a3ec7b87bc3d1c711bbd169c3ced4a0bd"],"user_facing":true,"description":"**Fixed mixed-case unquoted index/exclusion key columns false-drifting in diff.** A desired unquoted key column such as `Email` no longer reports a spurious change against PostgreSQL's lowercased introspected form; unquoted identifiers now fold to lowercase (matching PG), while quoted identifiers stay case-sensitive.","type":"fix"}
